+
+<!-- task body. `wingfoil memory add` copies this scaffold, setting only `id`, `title` and
+     `status` (and any `--tags` or `--set` value). Fill the required frontmatter fields and replace
+     these placeholder comments yourself; `wingfoil memory submit` then checks the required fields,
+     moves `status` forward and commits the document as you left it, naming in the commit body the
+     content it carries. -->
+
+# Request
+
+Three reports on the order service.
+
+1. Finance: a percentage coupon was computed on the gross amount instead of the subtotal after volume
+   discounts (12 notebooks at €5.00, 10% coupon: expected €48.60 of goods, got €48.00). Fixed in
+   `src/pricing.ts`: the coupon base is gross minus volume discounts, as the README states.
+2. Luca: coupon AUTUMN refused on its last day (30 November). Fixed in `src/coupons.ts`: the last day is
+   included (`>=` became `>`).
+3. Anna: asks to remove VAT on shipping. Not changed: the README, which prevails over the code, says
+   shipping is subject to VAT at the standard rate (22%), shown on its own line. Needs a business
+   decision to change the rule.
+
+Tests for 1 and 2 added to `test/regressions.test.ts`; `npm test` passes (19 tests).
